null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:27:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036017","verified_at":"2026-10-23T16:00:02Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112040-1846651706682816","game_id":"steam-5112040","kind":"announcement","title":"Demo Version 1.2 Launch","summary":"Demo Version 1.2 LaunchFollowing on from the fantastic feedback from players and demo testers we have made a large number of changes to the game, here is a run down of just some of the many changes:All new branding, Steam Assets and LogoNew trailer to show off the changes.Simplified the skyboxes so they are less distracting, they still have the nice big planet but quieter nebula like effects.Many changes to the UI including fixing the slight delay in opening some windows.All new SFX for weapons,","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-16T18:59:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706682816","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:46:27Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5112040-1844751498219008","game_id":"steam-5112040","kind":"announcement","title":"Enarian: Orbital Command - Beta Launch - 25th September 12pm GMT","summary":"Orbital Command - Beta Launch September 25th 12pm GMT The beta version of the game features everything that will be in the launch version, currently scheduled for the end of October 2026. It is limited to commander level 10, but should allow you to access all the key elements of the game and experience many of its contract types. About the Game Congratulations on your graduation from command school, but now you face a problem. No one is going to hire a green, rookie commander, to a permanent pos","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T16:36:44Z","time_precision":"minu